"icon:lock[title=Fixed at build time] [[quarkus-hibernate-orm_quarkus-hibernate-orm-dialect]] [.property-path]##link:#quarkus-hibernate-orm_quarkus-hibernate-orm-dialect[`+++quarkus.hibernate-orm.dialect+++`]##\n"
