"[[quarkus-hibernate-search-orm-outbox-polling_quarkus-hibernate-search-orm-coordination-tenants-tenant-id-mass-indexer-pulse-expiration]] [.property-path]##link:#quarkus-hibernate-search-orm-outbox-polling_quarkus-hibernate-search-orm-coordination-tenants-tenant-id-mass-indexer-pulse-expiration[`+++quarkus.hibernate-search-orm.coordination.tenants.\"tenant-id\".mass-indexer.pulse-expiration+++`]##\n"
