msgid ""
"[[quarkus-hibernate-search-orm-elasticsearch_quarkus-hibernate-search-orm-schema-management-strategy]] [.property-path]##link:#quarkus-hibernate-search-orm-elasticsearch_quarkus-hibernate-search-orm-schema-management-strategy[`+++quarkus.hibernate-search-orm.schema-management.strategy+++`]##\n"
